  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling and Scaling up Nature-related Financial Disclosures-UNDP-HQ-00133933</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS: 6652 - To accelerate achievement of the TNFD&#x2019;s missionThe project objective is &#x201c;Global financial flows shifted from nature-negative development outcomes toward nature-positive development outcomes.&#x201d; This project will help accelerate achievement of the TNFD&#x2019;s mission of launching an international financial disclosure and risk management framework to redirect global financial flows to more nature positive outcomes in line with the expected Global Biodiversity Framework (GBF) under the Conven</narrative>
  </description>
